Added seven parsing cases to `.agents/scripts/tests/test-aidevops-update-transaction.sh`: multiline and single-line ai-session, combined flags, non-deploying stages, repeated stages in both orders, and a missing final stage value. Verification: transaction suite **24 passed, 0 failed**; Bash syntax, native ShellCheck for both changed files, and `git diff --check` passed. Push hooks passed; local TypeScript checking was deferred by the existing hook to CI because `tsc` is not installed.

